ction><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span> 申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><font><span><span>1．面向国内各高校相关专业身体健康的大三学生（202</span></span></font></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><font><span><span>届毕业生），有浓厚科研兴趣，并有较强的或潜在的研究能力，其中，具有高校推免资格或拟具有高校推免资格并意向报考中国科学院广州地球化学研究所的学生优先录取；</span></span></font></span><p><span><font><span><span>2．学习成绩优秀</span></span></font><font><span><span>，本科总评成绩排名位于专业综合排名前</span></span></font><font><span><span>35％（有出色的科研成果或拥有专业相关特长、表现突出者可适当放宽），在学期间无重修科目或补考记录，在校期间没有受过纪律处分；</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>3．要求申报人为地质学、地球物理学、行星科学、环境科学与工程、大气科学、化学、海洋科学、材料科学等与地质、环境、行星、海洋等研究领域相关专业的本科生；</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>4．英语水平</span></span></font><font><span><span>良好，达到国家四</span></span></font><font><span><span>/六级水平，对有出色的科研成果者英语成绩可适当放宽。</span></span></font></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/H6cH6BLgVsg2gnCJQia1oftSM497Gibn9ibn6a1qq3NAiamkmrHiaGlPQVKNAZiaYKtAkT66ZafXK50osSa8QD9v1yDg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=5\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span> 申请方式及时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><font><span><span>1．网上报名：</span></span></font></span><b><u><span><font><span><span>6月1</span></span></font></span></u></b><b><u><span><span><span>0日前</span></span></span></u></b><span><font><span><span>，</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>登录中国科学院大学夏令营在线申请系统</span></span></font></span><u><span><span><span>http://zxsq.ucas.ac.cn/login/index/sc</span></span></span></u><span><span><span> </span></span></span><span><font><span><span>。登录后，承办单位选择：广州地球化学研究所，夏令营选择：中国科学院广州地化所</span></span></font><font><span><span>20</span></span></font></span><span><span><span>26</span></span></span><span><font><span><span>年</span></span></font><font><span><span>“资源环境与宜居地球”夏令营</span></span></font><font><span><span>。</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><font><span><span>．申请者在报名系统中需完整填写所有内容。</span></span></font><font><span><span>“所在年级（专业）人数”填写参与排名的所有学生人数；“年级（专业）排名”填写前6学期排名情况（如第6学期成绩未出，可按前5学期排名情况填写），如未排名可自行预估，不要空白或写0；“申请理由”着重填写本科期间的专业课程、科研实践活动、未来规划等；申请者需在“备注”栏中注明拟申报的专业及研究方向（请参考我所202</span></span></font></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><font><span><span>年招收攻读硕士学位研究生招生简章）。</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><br/></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>3．材料提交：申请阶段无需提供纸质材料，申请人须在6月</span></span></font></span><span><span><span>10日前</span></span></span><span><font><span><span>将材料扫描件按顺序整合为</span></span></font></span><b><span><font><span><span>一个</span></span></font><font><span><span>pdf文档</span></span></font></span></b><span><font><span><span>，文件名为：姓名</span></span></font><font><span><span>-学校，发送至yjs@gig.ac.cn，(邮件主题命名为：姓名+202</span></span></font></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><font><span><span>年夏令营材料</span></span></font><font><span><span>)。</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>(1) 中国科学院大学</span></span></font></span><span><span><span>2026年大学生暑期夏令营申请表（报名系统生成，本人签名）</span></span></span><span><font><span><span>；</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>(2) 本科已修课程的成绩单以及排名(加盖教务处或学院公章)；</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>(3) 英语水平证明（大学英语四、六级等相关英文能力证明）；</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>(4) 专业排名证明</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>（加盖院系公章）</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>；</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>(5) 身份证和学生证复印件（身份证正/反面、学生证里/外面）；</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>(6) 其他证明材料 （如已发表的论文、个人获奖证书等）。</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span></span></span></font></span><span><span><span></span></span></span><span><font><span><span></span></span></font></span><span><span><span></span></span></span><span><font><span><span>。</span></span></font></span></p><p><strong><span><span> </span></span><span><font><span><span>4．申请者请加入</span></span></font></span><span><span><span>2026年广州地化所</span></span></span><span><font><span><span>夏令营</span></span></font><font><span><span>QQ群：</span></span></font></span><span><span><span>1032963785</span></span></span><span><font><span><span>，申请入群时需备注</span></span></font><font><span><span>“姓名-本科学校”。</span></span></font></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/H6cH6BLgVsg2gnCJQia1oftSM497Gibn9ibn6a1qq3NAiamkmrHiaGlPQVKNAZiaYKtAkT66ZafXK50osSa8QD9v1yDg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#