pan></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><font><span><span>报名材料须真实有效，如弄虚作假，将取消录取资格，并将情况通报申请人学校。</span></span></font></span><p><span><font><span><span>因夏令营名额有限，被录取后确定不来参加夏令营的，请及时通知我们，以便为其他想参与活动的学生提供宝贵机会。</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>营员应遵守我所有关规定和夏令营统一安排，按时参加活动。</span></span></font></span></p><p><b><span><font><span><span>我所将</span></span></font></span></b><b><span><font><span><span>为每位</span></span></font></span></b><b><span><font><span><span>录取的</span></span></font></span></b><b><span><font><span><span>营员</span></span></font></span></b><b><span><font><span><span>提供夏令营期间的免费食宿。</span></span></font></span></b></p><span><font><span><span>　　夏令营期间学生安全由学生本人及学籍所在学校负责，我所将统一为营员购买人身意外伤害保险，报到时签署安全协议。</span></span></font></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/FYgh8CJcZcwb4Q1Gicyr0UZGHiau8T1XgnXxe9en3OMw1xibrHQSVKsMialynywZOJDUssBAXVLXNyrQ0Qlz40XfCGeic31libdJCFV5y0p6IjPyc/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/FYgh8CJcZcxnEaPVsr1stGIiahwhEalxmjXVA4hNE79kZBZRevXxxlew4mRMB1tb6wQNFHwpCQeuNfxM6ejpWCdqCv8VS7jLIffaAMmUiazNc/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/FYgh8CJcZcwSUUCA7PtwmTzz1HqzicCnVdEGiaeHvqO1kP0s0zzwajKnQpvwcJ5q3znglNB567RqP